<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila high interest rates hit property stocks.</title>
<headline>Manila high interest rates hit property stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine property issues Empire East Land Holdings Inc and Megaworld Properties &amp; Holdings Inc tumbled by at least five percent in the late session on concerns over high interest rates, analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Megaworld fell five percent to 2.85 pesos while subsidiary Empire East took a heavier beating, shedding 6.74 percent to 4.15 pesos.</p>
</text>
